      "writtenOn": "2023-06-21T22:34:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you\u0027re debugging PermissionControllerService on riscv64, I found it wasn\u0027t getting started at all. It gets put in mProcessesOnHold and that was never getting flushed (ActivityManagerService#finishBooting never got called).\n\nMy workaround was to set android:persistent\u003d\"true\" in PermissionController/AndroidManifest.xml, but I am sure this is not correct.",
      "revId": "0cb9c2c57a0860deed5df6b9b11e6423f8e325ab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9018a6d8_5a71a0a3",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
